# NOTE: data/ and reports/ are deliberately committed.
# The SQLite database is the project's raw-evidence record; OpenAlex data
# drifts over time, so the committed harvest is what makes analyses reproducible.

# SQLite scratch files (transient; the .db itself IS committed)
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
